<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2, h3 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.5em; }
  .header-logo-container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .form-section { margin-bottom: 30px; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: 20px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-row > div { width: 50%; }
  .form-row-full { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .input-group { display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .input-group label { margin-right: 10px; }
  .input-group input[type="text"], .input-group select { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 5px; }
  .signature-line { margin-top: 80px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo-container">
    <div>
      <h1>CUNY School of Medicine</h1>
    </div>
    <div>
      <img src="" alt="City College Logo" style="height: 70px;">
    </div>
  </div>
  <h2 style="text-align: center;">PERSONAL DATA CHANGE REQUEST FORM</h2>

  <p>Use this form to update your personal data (Name, Address, Telephone Number, SSN) as it appears on CUNYfirst. CUNY requires LEGAL documentation for any change in name or SSN. Please follow the instructions specified for each section below in order to provide the correct documentation. All requests should be submitted from a school email account and emailed to <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>. Incomplete forms will not be processed.</p>

  <!-- REQUIRED FOR ALL REQUESTS: CURRENT STUDENT INFORMATION -->
  <div class="form-section">
    <h3 style="text-align: center;">REQUIRED FOR ALL REQUESTS: CURRENT STUDENT INFORMATION</h3>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Last Name:</label>
        <span data-field="current_info.last_name">{{ current_info.last_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>First Name:</label>
        <span data-field="current_info.first_name">{{ current_info.first_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Middle Name/Initial:</label>
        <span data-field="current_info.middle_name">{{ current_info.middle_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Suffix:</label>
        <span data-field="current_info.suffix">{{ current_info.suffix }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>EMPLID:</label>
        <span data-field="current_info.emplid">{{ current_info.emplid }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Email:</label>
        <span data-field="current_info.email">{{ current_info.email }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- NAME UPDATE REQUESTS -->
  <div class="form-section">
    <h3 style="text-align: center;">NAME UPDATE REQUESTS</h3>
    <p>Please attach two types of appropriate documentation; one type of documentation must be either a marriage certificate, passport, birth certificate, social security card, divorce decree or a court order, the second must be a Photo ID.</p>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Last Name:</label>
        <span data-field="name_update.last_name">{{ name_update.last_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>First Name:</label>
        <span data-field="name_update.first_name">{{ name_update.first_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Middle Name/Initial:</label>
        <span data-field="name_update.middle_name">{{ name_update.middle_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Suffix:</label>
        <span data-field="name_update.suffix">{{ name_update.suffix }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ADDRESS UPDATE REQUESTS -->
  <div class="form-section">
    <h3 style="text-align: center;">ADDRESS UPDATE REQUESTS</h3>
    <p>Address and telephone number change requests do not require additional paperwork. Please note that if your address is changed from an out-of-state address to an in-state, it does not automatically qualify you for the in-state tuition rate. You must submit a Residency Application with required documentation to change your tuition rate to in-state. Changing your address to an out-of-state address will change your tuition rate for the next semester.</p>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Check All That Apply:</label>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 15px;">
          <label><input type="checkbox"> Billing</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> Home</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> Mailing</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox"> Permanent</label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Apt/Floor:</label>
        <span data-field="address_update.apt_floor">{{ address_update.apt_floor }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>Street Address:</label>
        <span data-field="address_update.street_address">{{ address_update.street_address }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Zip Code:</label>
        <span data-field="address_update.zip_code">{{ address_update.zip_code }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>City:</label>
        <span data-field="address_update.city">{{ address_update.city }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Phone Number:</label>
        <span data-field="address_update.phone_number">{{ address_update.phone_number }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SSN UPDATE REQUESTS -->
  <div class="form-section">
    <h3 style="text-align: center;">SSN UPDATE REQUESTS</h3>
    <p>Please submit a signed Social Security Card</p>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div>
        <label>New SSN:</label>
        <span data-field="ssn_update.new_ssn">{{ ssn_update.new_ssn }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SIGNATURE CONFIRMATION -->
  <div class="form-section" style="border-top: none;">
    <h3 style="text-align: center;">SIGNATURE CONFIRMATION</h3>
    <p>By signing below, I affirm that the information provided on this form is true and accurate. I certify that I am responsible for changes made to my official record and consequences that it may have.</p>
    <div class="signature-line">
      <div>
        <label>Student Signature</label>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 300px; margin-top: 50px;" data-field="student_signature">{{ student_signature }}</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label>Date</label>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 300px; margin-top: 50px;" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; font-size: small;">
    CUNY School of Medicine • Office of the Registrar • <span data-field="registrar_email">{{ registrar_email }}</span>
  </div>
</div>